    "notes": [
      "Draft full racing circuit through Bane 1 and the outer Bane 2 loop, identified from the venue facilities description and marshal-post map and checked on independently georeferenced licensed imagery. Coordinates and order use exact pinned OSM ways 102145330 version 18 and 338068128 version 2, with shared junction node IDs 1178910200 and 1178910082. Replaces only the generic longest-cycle training/pit detours. No diagram coordinates, stated width or nominal distance is fitted. Fine alignment and travel direction remain provisional. Public timing remains missing."
